<title>BELGIUM: EU clears BT/MCI merger.</title>
<headline>EU clears BT/MCI merger.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission on Wednesday cleared the merger between Britain's British Telecommunications and U.S. telecoms giant MCI Communications Corp after the companies made certain concessions.</p>
</text>
